# A node status request, id 0x1a2b, 50 bytes.
#
# The question name is "*" padded with nulls, then NetBIOS-encoded: every byte
# becomes two letters, its high and low nibble each added to 'A'. So 0x2a
# ('*') becomes "CK" and each 0x00 becomes "AA", which is why these packets
# are full of A's. Type 0x0021 is NBSTAT, "send me your whole name table".
1a2b0000000100000000000020434b41
41414141414141414141414141414141
41414141414141414141414141000021
0001
